592 0 obj
<<
/Title (Because BOOKING stores Customer_ID and Driver_ID, Booking_ID determines the customer and driver assigned to that booking. Therefore, if RATING.Booking_ID identifies a unique booking, the customer and driver for the rating can be checked through BOOKING. Storing those IDs again in RATING introduces a consistency rule that the database must enforce.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 579 0 R
>>
endobj
